 "gates_doc": "scripts/levels/c4/tunnels_level.gd (extends the registry level): an entry with \"scene\" is built only when the level plays one of those Story scenes (level_id, set before _ready); \"after\" / \"until\" / \"choice\" / \"fade\" are the registry gates (objectives of earlier scenes count as complete). Lights carry an empty \"after\" so they are named and their slow flicker runs. \"swing\" = 7-frame lamp strips (frame \"rest\" at rest) the train event swings, with the named light; \"event_fx\" = strips played once per train (after \"delay\" s); \"train\" = the freight train rolling over the yard above (scene C). camera_zones = the camera window per scene (the walk area of the other scene stays off screen); looks = canvas modulate + grade per scene.",
 "notes": [
